# 2026-10 bridge rebuild: op-ovsbr0-setup --seed-only (run from
# ovs-vswitchd/run) replaces the whole seed+uplink+addr chain in one atomic
# step; ovsbr0-cutover replaces the IP-cutover+alias tail. Only the OVS-side
# plumbing is retired here — tun5 must still never be enslaved into ovsbr0
# (that was the actual OD-104 regression). op-warp-ssh-host/-routes, the
# decoy-originated WARP/MASQUE SSH tunnel itself are NOT retired:
# the design goal is that every external observer sees nothing but ordinary
# WARP traffic to the decoy, including admin SSH. They stay live, just
# disconnected from the bridge.
ovsbr0-uplink
ovsbr0-eth0
ovsbr0-svc-addr
ovsbr0-tun5

